# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, doas$
$
  alpine -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
   -  Granted by           group wheel$
  [ ] SSH Keys             None$
   -  Password             None$
$
  george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
   -  Granted by           group wheel$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure doas, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Installs shadow first$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter your choice [0-2 or q]: 2$
$
# Create User ##################################################$
$
# Note$
# hardn needs useradd, from shadow, to create users.$
$
  User Configuration -------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Package              shadow$
$
   -  Install shadow$
      shadow$
      -not installed$
      +installed, with linux-pam, libbsd$
      $ apk add shadow$
$
  Install shadow? [y/N, 0 or q]: n$
$
# Operation Cancelled$
$
# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, doas$
$
  alpine -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
   -  Granted by           group wheel$
  [ ] SSH Keys             None$
   -  Password             None$
$
  george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
   -  Granted by           group wheel$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure doas, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Installs shadow first$
$
   0) Return$
$
